// 5339
[dbrow_5339]
table=dbtable_72
data=col3,The Preset tab allows you to save sets of items which you can quickly withdraw from your preset.

// 5340
[dbrow_5340]
table=dbtable_72
data=col3,Here you will see the items which the preset will attempt to load.
data=col5,interface_517:com_273
data=col6,-1
data=col7,3

// 5341
[dbrow_5341]
table=dbtable_72
data=col3,To store what you have currently equipped as a preset, use the overwrite button.<br><br>The checkboxes indicate which inventories will be loaded when using the 'load' button.
data=col5,interface_517:com_297
data=col6,-1
data=col7,1

// 5342
[dbrow_5342]
table=dbtable_72
data=col3,To withdraw a preset, use either:<br><br> - Load button to load all checkboxes<br><br> - Icon to load single inventory
data=col5,interface_517:com_84
data=col6,-1
data=col7,1

