// 5375
[dbrow_5375]
table=dbtable_72
data=col3,This is the Quest List, which you can filter or sort.<br><br>Selecting a quest will bring up details of the quest in the area on the right.
data=col5,interface_1783:com_18
data=col6,-1
data=col7,4

// 5376
[dbrow_5376]
table=dbtable_72
data=col3,Once you have started a quest, you can refer to the <col=FFCB05>quest journal</col> for guidance, and a summary of your progress.
