// 5378
[dbrow_5378]
table=dbtable_72
data=col3,The Animations tab shows all the different animations you can apply to your character.

// 5379
[dbrow_5379]
table=dbtable_72
data=col3,These buttons can be used to explore the different categories of animation.<br><br>Any animations you have access to will be shown in the area to the right.
data=col5,interface_1311:com_146
data=col6,-1
data=col7,4

// 5380
[dbrow_5380]
table=dbtable_72
data=col3,Selecting an animation will give you a preview of it here.
data=col5,interface_1311:com_344
data=col6,-1

// 5381
[dbrow_5381]
table=dbtable_72
data=col3,The <col=FFcb05>apply</col> button will apply the animation to your character.<br><br>If you don't have access to the animation, this button will allow you to <col=FFcb05>buy</col> it.
data=col5,interface_1311:com_474
data=col6,-1

