data=col3,Smash pumpkins to fill the <col=DC143C>Harvest Bonus</col> bar. When the <col=DC143C>Harvest Bonus</col> bar is filled you'll be able to choose from 2 bonus options. <col=FA7720>Pumpkin modifier</col> or a <col=8d52e5>reward item</col>!<br><br>Each pumpkin rewards some <col=89CFF0>H'oddments</col>, a seasonal currency that can be spent on the <col=89CFF0>H'oddments store</col> while the promotion is active, and for 7 days afterwards.
data=col5,interface_886:com_4
data=col6,-1
data=col7,1
data=col21,interface_886:com_4,-1

