data=col8,1

// 5608
[dbrow_5608]
table=dbtable_72
data=col3,This shows how many keys you have. One key opens one chest, and the prize is yours to keep! You have one key per day for free, or two if you're a member. You can also buy keys directly, or earn them during your adventures!
data=col5,interface_1253:com_42
data=col6,-1

// 5609
[dbrow_5609]
table=dbtable_72
data=col3,These gems contain the fantastic prizes in this game of Treasure Hunter! All of the chests contain one of these prizes, guaranteed! You may be offered some alternate prizes in some cases!
data=col5,interface_1253:com_348
data=col6,-1

// 5610
[dbrow_5610]
table=dbtable_72
data=col3,You can open one chest per game, and it will cost you one key to get the goodies waiting inside. To play, simply click a chest!<br><br>Good luck, and remember to come back every day to use your free keys!
