data=col6,Rainbow Modifier
data=col7,Gain more <col=F7F7F7>Rainbow Dust</col> by getting the <col=F7F7F7>Rainbow Dust</col> modifier to the front of the trail.<br>Spend the <col=F7F7F7>Rainbow Dust</col> to get a <col=F7F7F7>Rainbow Modifier</col> that will increase your upcoming multipliers!
