data=col5,Smouldering lamps!
data=col6,- Win Smouldering lamps.<br>- Smouldering lamps give XP in a skill of your choice.<br>- Using a smouldering lamp on a skill that you have Bonus XP in will instantly burn up that Bonus XP and convert it into additional direct XP.

