// 6384
[dbrow_6384]
table=dbtable_72
data=col3,What you see is what you get!<br><br>The colour of the <col=0xFFCB05>gems</col> that float above each chest show the <col=0xB32AB6>rarity</col> of the prize inside.<br>The number of gems indicates a <col=0x26c914>prize multiplier</col> between 1 and 5.<br>Within the gem is the <col=0xFFCB05>prize</col> that you'll get from the chest.<br>That way, you can pick the prize that's right for you!<br><br>If you use <col=0xFFCB05>multi key mode</col>, the promo will choose the most valuable prize for you, depending on the rarity and multiplier of each available prize.

// 6385
[dbrow_6385]
table=dbtable_156
data=col0,Foresight
data=col1,Foresee the prizes contained within each chest.
data=col3,6
data=col5,Use Treasure Hunter keys to select chests and win rewards! The <col=FFFFFF>gems</col> floating above each chest show you exactly what <col=FFFFFF>prize</col>, <col=FFFFFF>amount</col> and <col=0xB32AB6>rarity</col> you'll get if you choose that chest, so you can always pick the prize that's right for you!
data=col6,NEW: Win More Ultra-Rare Prizes!
data=col7,Now with even more chances to win <col=0xB065FF>ultra-rare prizes</col> including <col=FFFFFF>boxes of deathtouched darts</col>, and <col=FFFFFF>processors</col>, which can consume large amounts of proteans and dummies in an instant!<br>To find out more, check out the prizes in the promotion information on the right.
data=col8,Promotion Information
data=col9,dbrow_6387
data=col9,dbrow_6386

