// 6831
[dbrow_6831]
table=dbtable_158
data=col0,<col=0xF7F7F7>Finding Karima</col> will allow you to select one of the following wishes:

// 6832
[dbrow_6832]
table=dbtable_158
data=col3,trh_multiplier_x7,100,100
data=col4,0
data=col5,Multiplier
data=col6,Be granted a <col=FF00>x5 multiplier for 3 turns</col>. Alternatively you can enhance this wish up to a <col=FF00>x7 multiplier for 7 turns</col>!<br><br>Wish Tiers:<br>- x5 Multiplier for 3 turns.<br>- x5 Multiplier for 5 turns.<br>- x5 multiplier for 7 turns.<br>- x7 Multiplier for 7 turns!<br><br>This wish has a 15% chance as appearing as a wish option.

// 6833
[dbrow_6833]
table=dbtable_158
data=col1,obj_1004
data=col2,50000000
data=col4,5
data=col5,Coins
data=col6,Be granted <col=FF00>2.5 million coins</col>. Alternatively you can enhance this wish up to <col=FF00>50 million coins</col>!<br><br>Wish Tiers:<br>- 2.5 million coins.<br>- 5 million coins.<br>- 10 million coins.<br>- 20 million coins.<br>- 50 million coins.<br><br>This wish has a 0.95% chance as appearing as a wish option.

// 6834
[dbrow_6834]
table=dbtable_158
data=col1,obj_47666
data=col2,2
data=col4,5
data=col5,Phoenix Lamps
data=col6,Be granted a <col=FF00>Large phoenix lamp</col>. Alternatively you can enhance this wish up to <col=FF00>2x Giant phoenix lamps</col>!<br><br>Wish Tiers:<br>- Large phoenix lamp.<br>- Huge phoenix lamp.<br>- Giant phoenix lamp.<br>- 2 x Giant phoenix lamps!<br><br>This wish has a 28% chance as appearing as a wish option.

// 6835
[dbrow_6835]
table=dbtable_158
data=col1,obj_48273
data=col2,2
data=col4,5
data=col5,Bubbling Lamps
data=col6,Be granted a <col=FF00>Large bubbling lamp</col>. Alternatively you can enhance this wish up to <col=FF00>2x Giant bubbling lamps</col>!<br><br>Wish Tiers:<br>- Large bubbling lamp.<br>- Huge bubbling lamp.<br>- Giant bubbling lamp.<br>- 2 x Giant bubbling lamps!<br><br>This wish has a 28% chance as appearing as a wish option.

// 6836
[dbrow_6836]
table=dbtable_158
data=col1,obj_40201
data=col2,2
data=col4,5
data=col5,Supreme Stars
data=col6,Be granted a <col=FF00>Large supreme star</col>. Alternatively you can enhance this wish up to a <col=FF00>2x Giant supreme stars</col>!<br><br>Wish Tiers:<br>- Large supreme star.<br>- Huge supreme star.<br>- Giant supreme star.<br>- 2x Giant supreme stars!<br><br>This wish has a 28.05% chance as appearing as a wish option.

// 6837
[dbrow_6837]
table=dbtable_158
data=col1,obj_36196
data=col2,3
data=col4,5
data=col5,Skill Training Dummies
data=col6,Be granted a <col=FF00>Large skill training dummy crate</col>. Alternatively you can enhance this wish up to <col=FF00>3x Large skill training dummy crates</col>!<br><br>Wish Tiers:<br>- Medium skill training dummy crate.<br>- Large skill training dummy crate.<br>- 2 x Large skill training dummy crate.<br>- 3 x Large skill training dummy crate!<br><br>This wish has a 13% chance as appearing as a wish option.

// 6838
[dbrow_6838]
table=dbtable_158
data=col1,obj_50442
data=col2,20
data=col4,5
data=col5,Combat Training Dummies
data=col6,Be granted <col=FF00>5 x Combat training dummies</col>. Alternatively you can enhance this wish up to <col=FF00>20 x Combat training dummies</col>!<br><br>Wish Tiers:<br>- 5 x Combat training dummies.<br>- 10 x Combat training dummies.<br>- 15 x Combat training dummies.<br>- 20 x Combat training dummies!<br><br>This wish has a 12.5% chance as appearing as a wish option.

