data=col5,Use Treasure Hunter keys to open chests and win rewards! Keys can be purchased or earned through completing quests and playing the game. You will also be given free daily keys every day!
data=col6,The Solstice Showdown
data=col7,Choose a knight to attack! Whenever a knight's life points drop to zero you will receive a guaranteed  <col=FFFF00>unowned piece of their armour set</col> as well as a <col=FFFF00>sigil</col>!<br><br>Attacking the <col=FF6600>Solar Knight</col> will provide you with a <col=FF00>guaranteed rarity bonus</col> whereas attacking the <col=3366FF>Lunar Knight</col> will provide you with a <col=FF00>multiplier bonus</col>!
