data=col0,Loot Rooms
data=col1,Choose your chest and a copy appears in the Loot Room!
data=col2,trh_ui_icon_chest,70,50
data=col3,0
data=col5,Loot Room allows you to choose from a variety of special chests, each of them having their own special identity! Choose from <col=FF00>multipliers</col>, <col=0xFFCB05>money chests</col> and a whole bunch more!<br><br>Select a chest to use a Treasure Hunter Key and receive your reward.
data=col6,Loot Room
data=col7,Opening a special chest will put a copy of it in the <col=0xFFCB05>Loot Room</col>. Whenever the <col=0xFFCB05>Loot Room</col> is full you can claim <col=0xFFCB05>4 of the chests for free!</col>
