data=col3,Once you have opened all the small eggs, you can open the <col=0xFFCB05>Bonus Egg</col> to receive a modifier that applies to your next egg hunt.<br><br>Bonuses includes <col=FF6600>guaranteed rarity</col> or <col=FF00>prize multipliers</col> for the next 8 eggs!

